Note: Indices 0x66-0xA7 and 0xB3-0xDF are explicitly empty spaces (' ') in the code.

Important Notes:
Indices > 127 (0x7F): These point to the "upper half" of the ASCII table involved in 
glcdfont_as.c
, which typically contains custom icons (modifiers, system icons, logos).
' ' (Space): Entries mapped to 32 (' ') are seemingly ignored by the 
trigger_matrix_rain
 function.